@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate

-- ===========================================================================
-- domain.l4 — the nouns, and nothing else.
--
-- Regulation of Engagement in Work on Refrigeration or Air-Conditioning
-- Systems Law 5785-2025 (Sefer HaChukim 3349, 14 January 2025, p. 182), and
-- the Fees Regulations made under its ss. 59-60, in three vintages.
--
-- Every type here is a fact a witness of ordinary competence could testify
-- to. Whether a fact makes a rule bite is decided in the module for that
-- provision, never here. No rules, no #EVAL.
--
-- Amounts in every module of this encoding are new Israeli shekels (NIS).
-- Periods are days unless a name says otherwise.
-- ===========================================================================

§ `Domain`

§§ `The three vintages of the Fees Regulations`

-- The brief pins three texts. A fee lookup takes the vintage as an input;
-- nothing is ever borrowed from one vintage to answer for another.
DECLARE Vintage IS ONE OF
    `the draft`
    -- טיוטת תקנות ... (אגרות), התשפ"ה–2025: only what the SimpLEX
    -- screenshot (Schwartz, Bar-Siman-Tov & Gelbard 2025, Figure 4) shows.
    `the regulations as made`
    -- קובץ התקנות 11951, 9 July 2025, p. 2116
    `the regulations as amended`
    -- as amended by קובץ התקנות 12383, 4 May 2026, p. 2062

§§ `Exams and the services the Fees Regulations price`

DECLARE Exam IS ONE OF
    `a theoretical exam`
    @nlg:he בחינה עיונית
    `a practical exam`
    @nlg:he בחינה מעשית

-- The services s. 59 of the Law lets the Minister charge for, in the shape
-- the three vintages of reg 2 name them. A service any vintage is silent on
-- stays in the list, so that the silence is an answer a caller can see.
DECLARE Service IS ONE OF
    `taking` HAS `the exam` IS AN Exam
    -- "בעד בחינה ..." (reg 2(a) in every vintage; (a1) as amended)
    `an objection to the grade of` HAS `the exam objected to` IS AN Exam
    -- as made and as amended: "השגה על ציון הבחינה"; the draft: "ערעור על
    -- הבחינה" (an appeal). The encoding treats the two words as one service
    -- and records the difference in the fork register.
    `a licence, or the renewal of one, under section 5`
    `a temporary licence for a foreign expert, or the renewal of one, under section 9`
    -- the draft's reg 2(ה) cites "סעיף 8"; see the fork register.
    `a continuing-training course under section 17`
    -- s. 59 authorises a fee for these; no vintage sets one.

-- One sub-regulation of regulation 2, as printed: its label, the services it
-- prices, the amount, and its words. Each vintage's regulation 2 is a list
-- of these, in the vintage's own order.
DECLARE `Regulation 2 provision` HAS
    `the sub-regulation`     IS A STRING
    `the services it prices` IS A LIST OF Service
    `the amount`             IS A NUMBER
    `the words`              IS A STRING

DECLARE `What the licence fee is charged on` IS ONE OF
    `the application for the licence or its renewal`
    -- draft reg 2(ד): "בעד בקשה לקבלת רישיון או לחידושו"
    `the receipt of the licence or its renewal`
    -- reg 2(ג) as made: "בעד קבלת רישיון או חידושו"

§§ `A request under regulation 4`

-- One request is one service asked for once: one exam sitting, one
-- objection ("בעד כל השגה" — per objection), one licence.
DECLARE Request HAS
    `the service requested` IS A Service
    `the amount paid`       IS A NUMBER

-- What regulation 4 does to a request. The third member is the law's own
-- answer, not a gap: reg 4 bites only on a service "שנקבעה בעדו אגרה", for
-- which a fee was set, so a service no fee is set for is outside it.
DECLARE `What regulation 4 does to the request` IS ONE OF
    `not withheld: the fee set for the service was paid in full`
    `withheld: the fee set for the service was not paid in full`
    `not reached: no fee is set for the service`

-- The outcome words of the SimpLEX test table and of its worked example,
-- in English, with the Hebrew as transcribed from the screenshot image.
DECLARE `SimpLEX expected outcome` IS ONE OF
    `registration approved`
    @nlg:he הרשמה מאושרת
    `the appeal is examined`
    @nlg:he הערעור נבדק
    `suspension of service`
    @nlg:he השעיית שירות
    `registration rejected — payment must be completed`
    @nlg:he הרשמה נדחית – חובה להשלים תשלום

§§ `Consumer price index figures (regulation 3)`

-- One published figure of the consumer price index of the Central Bureau of
-- Statistics. No figure is in the sources; a caller supplies them.
DECLARE `Index publication` HAS
    `year of publication`  IS A NUMBER
    `month of publication` IS A NUMBER
    `the index figure`     IS A NUMBER

§§ `The text of the Fees Regulations in force on a day`

DECLARE `Fees Regulations in force` IS ONE OF
    `no Fees Regulations were yet in force`
    `in force` HAS `the text in force` IS A Vintage

§§ `Licences and the systems they cover`

DECLARE `Licence grade` IS ONE OF
    `grade 1`
    @nlg:he רישיון דרגה 1
    `grade 2`
    @nlg:he רישיון דרגה 2
    `grade 3`
    @nlg:he רישיון דרגה 3

-- A refrigeration or air-conditioning installation, as a witness describes it.
DECLARE System HAS
    `removes heat from a given material or space`              IS A BOOLEAN
    `does so by means of a refrigerant`                        IS A BOOLEAN
    `cooling capacity in kilowatts`                            IS A NUMBER
    `operates with a flammable refrigerant listed in the Fourth Schedule` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the use of that refrigerant is permitted by law`          IS A BOOLEAN
    `of a type exempted by an order under section 3(b)`        IS A BOOLEAN

-- A piece of work on a system. The First Schedule (which works need which
-- licence) is outside this encoding's scope, so its answer for this work is
-- recorded here, as read off the Schedule, not computed.
DECLARE Work HAS
    `the system worked on` IS A System
    `an action of a type set out in the First Schedule` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the licence types column A of the First Schedule sets against this work` IS A LIST OF `Licence grade`
    `the day the work is done` IS A DATE

DECLARE Licence HAS
    `the grade`                                  IS A `Licence grade`
    `temporary, for a foreign expert, under section 9` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the day it was granted or last renewed`     IS A DATE
    -- s. 9(a): the Registrar sets a temporary licence's period, "שלא תעלה על
    -- שנה". NOTHING for an ordinary licence, whose period s. 8 computes.
    `the last day of the period the Registrar set, for a temporary licence` IS A MAYBE DATE
    `cancelled or suspended under section 10`    IS A BOOLEAN
    `the work is in accordance with the conditions of the licence and the provisions under this Law` IS A BOOLEAN

DECLARE `Person doing the work` HAS
    `the licence held` IS A MAYBE Licence

§§ `Qualifications (section 6(a)(4) and the Second Schedule)`

-- A certificate, by its issuer and its words. The Second Schedule names each
-- of these; s. 2 defines which of them are "completion certificates".
DECLARE Certificate IS ONE OF
    `a completion certificate in refrigeration and air-conditioning studies from the Division`
    `a grade 1 refrigeration and air-conditioning completion certificate from the Division`
    `a grade 2 refrigeration and air-conditioning completion certificate from the Division`
    `a grade 3 refrigeration and air-conditioning completion certificate from the Division`
    `a completion certificate in refrigeration and air-conditioning studies from a youth vocational school of the Division`
    `a Ministry of Education completion certificate in climate-control studies at 3 study units`
    `a Ministry of Education completion certificate in climate-control studies at 5 study units`

-- One item of prior training, experience or completed study, in the Second
-- Schedule's own words. A course is identified as the Schedule identifies
-- it: by its length cap and the certificate it confers.
DECLARE Qualification IS ONE OF
    `holding` HAS `the certificate held` IS A Certificate
    `a licence of` HAS `the licence grade held` IS A `Licence grade`
    `completion of the Division's training of up to` HAS
        `the hours` IS A NUMBER
        `the certificate it confers` IS A Certificate
    `registration as a certified technician in the refrigeration and air-conditioning branch and section`
    `registration as a practical engineer in the refrigeration and air-conditioning branch and section`
    `completion of a study programme that includes the supplementary course`
    `registration as an engineer in the mechanical branch under the Engineers and Architects Law 5718-1958`
    `one year of cumulative experience within the three years before the licence application`
    `three years of cumulative experience within the seven years before the licence application`

DECLARE Applicant HAS
    `of full age`                         IS A BOOLEAN
    `an Israeli citizen`                  IS A BOOLEAN
    `a resident of Israel`                IS A BOOLEAN
    -- s. 6(a)(3) "לדעת הרשם": the Registrar's determination, recorded.
    `convicted of, or under a pending indictment for, an offence that in the Registrar's opinion makes the applicant unfit to hold a licence` IS A BOOLEAN
    `prior training, experience and completed studies` IS A LIST OF Qualification
    -- s. 7
    `holds a valid electricity licence listed in paragraphs (1) to (7) of regulation 7 of the Electricity (Licences) Regulations 5745-1985` IS A BOOLEAN
    `holds a valid work-at-height approval under regulations 5 and 6 of the Work Safety (Work at Height) Regulations 5767-2007` IS A BOOLEAN

-- A certificate as issued, for the s. 2 definition of "תעודת גמר".
DECLARE `Issuer of a certificate` IS ONE OF
    `the Division for vocational training`
    `the Ministry of Education`
    `someone else`

DECLARE `Certificate as issued` HAS
    `issued by`                                                       IS AN `Issuer of a certificate`
    `attests completion of refrigeration and air-conditioning studies` IS A BOOLEAN
    `attests passing an exam the Division conducted`                  IS A BOOLEAN
    `that exam included a theoretical exam`                           IS A BOOLEAN
    `that exam included a practical exam`                             IS A BOOLEAN
    `attests successful completion of studies in the climate-control track` IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `The Second Schedule's three columns`

-- Column A: "כל אחד מאלה" (any one of these), or a single item, or "בלא
-- הכשרה או ניסיון קודמים". Items 2 of Parts B and C join two facts with
-- "and" ("..., וסיום תוכנית לימודים הכוללת את קורס ההשלמה").
DECLARE `Column A entry` IS ONE OF
    `without prior training or experience`
    `any one of` HAS `the alternatives` IS A LIST OF Qualification
    `both of` HAS `the two` IS A LIST OF Qualification

-- Column B: "אחת מאלה" (one of these), a single requirement, or "בלא
-- דרישות נוספות".
DECLARE `Column B entry` IS ONE OF
    `one of` HAS `the requirements` IS A LIST OF Qualification
    `no further requirements`

-- Column C: the only note the Schedule carries.
DECLARE `Column C entry` IS ONE OF
    `no note`
    `in force for three years from the commencement of this Law under section 63(a)(1)`

DECLARE `Second Schedule item` HAS
    `the part`        IS A `Licence grade`
    `the item number` IS A NUMBER
    `column A`        IS A `Column A entry`
    `column B`        IS A `Column B entry`
    `column C`        IS A `Column C entry`

§§ `Duties of a licence holder (sections 16 and 17)`

DECLARE `Change of particulars` HAS
    `the day of the change`              IS A DATE
    `the day the Registrar was notified` IS A MAYBE DATE

DECLARE `Course attended` HAS
    `the day attended`                                              IS A DATE
    `hours`                                                         IS A NUMBER
    `under the supervision of the Ministry`                         IS A BOOLEAN
    `conducted by the Registrar or recognised by the Division`      IS A BOOLEAN
    `in the field of the holder's work under the licence`           IS A BOOLEAN
    `on a date the Registrar directed`                              IS A BOOLEAN
    `the holder met the course's requirements`                      IS A BOOLEAN

DECLARE `Foreign applicant` HAS
    `from a foreign state`                                              IS A BOOLEAN
    `invited to Israel to work on a system whose cooling capacity, in kilowatts, is` IS A NUMBER
    `authorised to work on refrigeration or air-conditioning systems in a foreign state` IS A BOOLEAN
    `installed or maintained similar systems in the six years before the application` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- s. 9(a)(3): the Registrar's recognition, recorded.
    `recognised by the Registrar as having a reputation and as a renowned expert in the field` IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Parties and acts (for the duties in sections 3, 6, 16 and 17)`

DECLARE Party IS ONE OF
    `the person doing the work`
    `the Registrar`
    `the licence holder`
    `the Director of the Division`
    `the Division for vocational training`
    `the Director-General of the Ministry of Labour`

DECLARE Act IS ONE OF
    `give or renew the licence`
    `allow the exam to be taken`
    `allow the objection to be filed`
    `publish in Reshumot the text of regulation 2 as updated`
    `do work on the refrigeration or air-conditioning system`
    `grant the licence`
    `notify the Registrar of the change in particulars`
    `take part in at least eight hours of continuing-training courses`
    `grant the exemption from training`
    `grant a temporary licence`
    `ensure that courses exist and are available`
    `publish the courses on the Ministry's website`
    `publish how to apply for an exemption from training`
    `renew the temporary licence`
    `require the holder to take part in a specific course`
